Dear Fernanda,
 you cannot deal with clusters explicitly in gdistsamp so I'm afraid you'll have to adopt some alternative technologies. We explained how to fit HDS models with group size in volume 1 of the AHM book (chapter 9) using JAGS, which I would recommend...
regards,
andy

